MANIFEST

# ROS 2 / colcon build artefacts created at repo root when the workspace
# is built in-place (only happens on dev machines / PC2 mirror; CI uses
# isolated build dirs under /home/run/getsolo/ on PC2). The install/ and
# log/ dirs carry COLCON_IGNORE markers, so colcon itself treats them
# as terminal -- safe to drop from version control.
/install/
/log/

# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

